{"t":"ARRY","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Array Technologies, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Solar","employees":1200,"hq":"Albuquerque, NM, United States","website":"https://arraytechinc.com","summary_en":"Array Technologies, Inc. engages in the manufacture and sale of solar tracking technology products in the United States, Spain, Brazil, Australia, and internationally. It operates through two segments, Array Legacy Operations and STI Operations. The company's products portfolio includes DuraTrack HZ V3, a single axis tracker; Array STI H250, a dual-row tracker system; Array OmniTrack; Array SkyLink, a photovoltaic-powered control tracker system; and SmarTrack, a software and control-based product. Array Technologies, Inc. was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Albuquerque, New Mexico.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Array Technologies, Inc.는 미국, 스페인, 브라질, 호주 및 국제적으로 태양광 추적 기술 제품의 제조 및 판매에 종사하고 있습니다. 이는 어레이 레거시 운영(Array Legacy Operations)과 STI 운영(STI Operations)이라는 두 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 회사의 제품 포트폴리오에는 단일 축 추적기인 DuraTrack HZ V3; 이중 행 추적 시스템인 Array STI H250; 어레이 OmniTrack; 광전지 구동 제어 추적 시스템인 Array SkyLink; 소프트웨어 및 제어 기반 제품인 SmarTrack이 있습니다. Array Technologies, Inc.는 1987년에 설립되었으며 뉴멕시코 주 앨버커키에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":3.795,"mcap":585452224.0,"pe":null,"fpe":4.4189053,"peg":0.38,"ps":0.52191764,"pb":-2.8090305,"ev_ebitda":20.396,"div":0.0,"beta":1.785,"hi52":12.23,"lo52":3.09},"fin":{"rev":1121732992.0,"rev_g":-0.161,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.25021,"op":0.04004,"net":-0.099139996,"roe":-0.31494,"fcf":125532496.0,"cash":143280000.0,"debt":759380992.0,"de":251.767,"eps":-1.13,"feps":0.85881},"own":{"short":0.32849997,"inst":1.35332,"insider":0.007850001},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":6.95263,"median":6.0,"high":12.0,"low":4.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.19048,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":8,"hold":12,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":10,"hold":13,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"peri